 "description": "Commutes between San Francisco and the other Bay Area counties by ACS survey year, from the 2020-2024 5-year PUMS (California person file): each year's records read on their own (SERIALNO's first four characters), their 5-year weights times 5 giving that year's estimate. Workers who worked at home left out; residence county from PUMA, workplace county from POWSP 006 and POWPUMA. Modes: bus (02, which includes the private commuter shuttles), subway or elevated (03, BART), long-distance train or commuter rail (04, Caltrain). Used for the model year's commutes across the city line (calibrate.ts OUT_2024) and as evidence that the pooled 2020-2024 county flows understate the Caltrain corridor's commuting in 2024-26.",
 "source": "U.S. Census Bureau, American Community Survey 2020-2024 5-year Public Use Microdata Sample, California persons (csv_pca_2024_5yr.zip); tabulated by server/beta3/pipeline/research/pums_caltrain_years.py",
